					<v8:lang>vi</v8:lang>
					<v8:content>Công đoạn</v8:content>
				</v8:item>
			</title>
			<presentationExpression>Case When ValueType(Stage) = Type("Document.ProductionStage2_2") Then ProductionManagement.PresentationStage(Stage.Number, Stage.StageName) Else Stage.Description End</presentationExpression>
		</field>
